# შემდეგ is წინ's antonym and its mirror in every respect: a postposition
# governing the genitive, so "სამი თვის შემდეგ" is three months from now.
# en.wiktionary.org, შემდეგ ("+ genitive case", "after") --
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E1%83%A8%E1%83%94%E1%83%9B%E1%83%93%E1%83%94%E1%83%92
შემდეგ
